  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "Turkey–Libya EEZ agreement",
   "text": "On November 27, 2019, the memorandum of understanding between the government of Turkey and the government of Libya on the delimitation of maritime jurisdiction areas in the Mediterranean was signed in Istanbul and was found to be in compliance with Law No. 7195 in Turkey.",
